    "title": "Fire Station 4 Re-Bid - NewsBreak",
    "text": "jacksontwp.com\nwebsite\nJackson\nFire Station 4 Re-Bid\n12 hours ago\nFIRE STATION 4 – 2ND FLOOR RESTROOM RENOVATIONS. Sealed bids for the Fire Station 4 – 2nd Floor Restroom Renovations Project (Re-Bid) will be received at the Office of the Board of Trustees of Jackson Township, Stark County, Ohio, 5735 Wales Avenue NW, Massillon, Ohio 44646 or may be submitted online through the Township’s electronic bidding service at www.BidExpress.com until 4:00 p.m. local time on Tuesday, November 13, 2025. Bids will be publicly opened and read on Tuesday, November 13, 2025 at 5:00 p.m., unless extended by written notice of the change shall be given to all persons who have received or requested the specification no later than 72 hours prior to the date fixed for such opening.\n2",
